      "text": "# dsh-theme-endfield bundle patch\n#\n# This file is the `dsh.bundle.patch` layer of the package: when installed\n# through the official CLI —\n#\n#   dsh plugin --profile web add github:ymh0000123/dsh-theme-endfield\n#\n# — the command reconciles `dsh.profile.bundles` against installed packages\n# and, seeing this declaration, appends `dsh-theme-endfield` to the bundle\n# stack. Profile boot then merges THIS patch (a single `insert` of the plugin\n# row) exactly like a manual cordis.patch.yml mount line. No profile file\n# edits needed — one command installs and mounts. The same row is also the\n# `dsh.client` browser-roster entry the web modules half scans for the client\n# bundle (exports[\"./client\"] -> client.js).\n- insert:\n    - id: theme-endfield\n      name: 'dsh-theme-endfield'\n"
